<li><strong>Walchand College of Engineering, Sangli:</strong> A premier autonomous institute with great infrastructure and alumni network.</li>
</ol>
<h2>Conclusion</h2>
<p>Cracking MHT CET 2025 requires consistent effort, a strategic approach, and the right study materials. Stick closely to the Maharashtra State Board textbooks, solve as many PYQs as possible, and give numerous mock tests to build your speed and accuracy. Remember, there is no negative marking, so approach the exam with confidence. Good luck with your preparation!</p>'
