<li><strong>Career Roles:</strong> Cyber Security Analyst, Ethical Hacker, Security Architect, Blockchain Developer.</li>
<li><strong>Placement Potential:</strong> High and incredibly stable. There is currently a global shortage of qualified cybersecurity professionals, leading to excellent job security and premium salaries.</li>
</ul>
<h2>4. Internet of Things (IoT)</h2>
<p>The Internet of Things refers to the billions of physical devices worldwide that are now connected to the internet, all collecting and sharing data. This includes everything from smart home thermostats and wearable health monitors to connected factory machinery and smart city infrastructure.</p>
<ul>
